{
  "name": "landing-rc4-final",
  "summary": "Every 1.0.0 fix since rc.3 at once: the rings, marks and reflows they fix, the sampler and walk reading what a visitor sees",
  "head": "bd4e117b9eacf8d043b8d6b2c783860175ff3611",
  "base": "d599c309405b0a8b8b4291fa0ea8a87e38de9d0d",
  "gate": true,
  "unit": {
    "titles": [
      "the repository passes its own audit: every finding has a reviewed exception, and every exception a finding",
      "Pause ships waiting: no box by default, its place kept unseen only where script runs and would show it",
      "no rule styles by a scripting query; the page and the case study carry the no-script mark last in the sky",
      "every variant's compiled stylesheet, the kit's layout included, is inside its manifest's css budget",
      "C5: folios, page numbers and durations sit on their row's baseline",
      "C2: the measures count characters as the faces render, and tables, meta lines and dates never wrap early",
      "the stylesheet styles its own elements, never a primitive's slots, and keys nothing on a display mode",
      "the stylesheet reads the platform's scales: no length of its own in a padding, margin, or gap",
      "readStructure reads the boundary and its names in one task of the page, so an element the page adds between two of its tasks can't put them out of step",
      "torn down, the controller refits nothing and leaves none of its attributes on the shell",
      "on a phone the title card’s tagline band keeps space under it, with no bottom bar to give it (HOR-4)",
      "on a phone the full record’s rows have room around and between their lines, on the scenes’ inset (HOR-5)",
      "print leaves the visitor's Appearance controls off the page",
      "the ticker: hidden from assistive technology, every fact shown elsewhere as text, off by control",
      "print is opaque and still",
      "the case study: month and year, the aside, the fact sheet rows the work has",
      "with script off the parser reaches the no-script mark before every part its rules style",
      "Flux reserves its phone dock's room at the window's block end, in the query the dock docks in",
      "a control Tab brings up from below a phone's dock stops clear of it by the dock, the ring's reach and more",
      "every bundled variant and pack declares budgets within its ceilings",
      "on the top line its own links and the visitor’s control ring in the band’s ink, and the Appearance summary rings inside its own box",
      "on the strip the open Appearance panel drops from the band’s foot on its own surface, held to the window under the band, in the canvas’s ink",
      "every gate so far has a known-bad case and a known-good one, and each id is unique"
    ]
  },
